nsform duration-700\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-server\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Industrial Panel AC Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">CNC machines and server panels in Vadodara&#8217;s GIDC zones require 100% uptime. Our specialists provide expert <strong>Himalaya panel AC repair</strong> and maintenance, ensuring your critical electronic infrastructure never overheats, even during high-production shifts.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Ac-circuit.webp\" alt=\"Himalaya AC PCB Repair Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-microchip\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">PCB &amp; Circuit Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Himalaya inverter models rely on complex motherboards. Voltage spikes in Gujarat can damage these delicate circuits. Instead of suggesting an expensive new board, our engineers offer specialized <strong>Himalaya AC PCB repair Vadodara</strong>, fixing components locally to save you money.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/emergency-ac-repair-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Himalaya AC Gas Filling Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-gas-pump\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Scientific Gas Recharging</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Gas refilling is never a standalone job. If gas is low, there&#8217;s a leak. Our <strong>Himalaya AC gas filling in Vadodara</strong> includes a full nitrogen pressure test to find the leak, silver brazing the hole, vacuuming the system, and filling the exact weight of high-quality refrigerant.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹2500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Atlas-aircon-vehicle.webp\" alt=\"Himalaya AC Deep Cleaning Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-water\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Power Jet Cleaning</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Surface cleaning isn&#8217;t enough for the dust of Vadodara. Our <strong>Himalaya AC deep cleaning</strong> uses high-pressure water jet pumps and specialized foaming chemicals to strip away the mold, slime, and dust trapped deep inside your cooling coils and blower fan.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹999</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"guide\" class=\"py-16 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-yellow-50/50 skew-x-12 transform origin-top-right z-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 max-w-6xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Expert Tips for AC Longevity</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Understanding the basics of HVAC thermodynamics can help you prevent major breakdowns and save on energy costs.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-12 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-lg text-justify md:text-left\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-wind text-blue-500 mr-3\"></i> 1. The Myth of Gas Consumption</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            One of the most common myths we encounter is that an air conditioner &#8220;uses up&#8221; its gas over time. Scientifically, this is impossible. Refrigerant gas exists in a hermetically sealed, closed-loop copper system. If your cooling has dropped and a tech tells you that you just &#8220;need a top-up,&#8221; they are ignoring a leak.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            Whenever we perform <strong>Himalaya AC gas filling in Vadodara</strong>, our primary goal is to find where that gas escaped. It could be a loose nut, a microscopic hole in the condenser, or a rub-through in the copper pipes. By finding and sealing the leak first, we ensure that your system stays cold for the entire season, not just a few weeks.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-shield-virus text-green-500 mr-3\"></i> 2. Why Dirty Filters are AC Killers</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            When clients ask us, &#8220;<strong>why is my Himalaya AC not cooling?</strong>&#8220;, the answer is usually as simple as a layer of dust. Your AC pulls heat from the air. If the air filters are blocked, the machine can&#8217;t &#8220;breathe.&#8221; This forces the compressor to work at 100% capacity just to maintain a basic temperature, causing it to overheat and eventually shut down.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            A bi-weekly <strong>Himalaya AC filter cleaning</strong> is the single best thing you can do for your machine. You don&#8217;t need a pro for this—just rinse the mesh filters under cool water, let them dry, and put them back. This habit alone can extend your unit&#8217;s life by up to 5 years and cut your electricity bill by 15%.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry text-red-500 mr-3\"></i> 3. Industrial Panel AC Maintenance</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            Industrial environments in Vadodara are dusty and hot. This is a nightmare for electrical panels. If your <strong>Himalaya panel AC</strong> isn&#8217;t serviced regularly, the internal heat buildup will fry your CNC machine&#8217;s delicate PLC boards.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            Our industrial engineering squad provides specialized chemical cleaning for panel ACs, ensuring they can handle the ambient heat of a busy shop floor. We focus on heavy-duty condenser cleaning and checking the thermal sensors to ensure your production line never stops because of a cooling failure.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Diagnostic Error Matrix</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Is your display flashing? Here is the technical breakdown for common <strong>Himalaya AC error codes</strong> and the actions you should take.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-700\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse m-0\">\n                            <thead>\n                                <tr class=\"bg-gray-950 text-gray-300 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/6\">Display</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/3\">Technical Fault</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/2\">Intervention Protocol</th>\n                                </tr>\n                            </thead>\n                            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-700 text-base\">\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">CF</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Airflow Restriction</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The unit detects that it cannot pull in enough air. Clean the dust filters immediately. If the error persists, the internal blower fan is likely choked.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">E1 / 21</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Ambient Sensor Failure</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The sensor measuring the room&#8217;s temperature is sending incorrect resistance values. A quick <strong>Himalaya AC sensor repair</strong> is needed.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">E5</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Communication Error</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The brain of the AC (Indoor PCB) can&#8217;t talk to the heart (Outdoor Inverter). Shut off the power and call us for an electrical check.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">EC</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Low Refrigerant Warning</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The unit senses a drop in pressure. Stop using the AC immediately to prevent a permanent compressor seizure.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl\">\n                <div class=\"tex