t Charging</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-500 hidden md:table-cell\">Finding the leak and refilling R32/R410A gas</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-[#D4AF37] text-right text-lg whitespace-nowrap\">₹2500 &#8211; ₹4500</td>\n                            </tr>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4 text-center\">*Baseline estimates only. Final <strong>Himalaya AC repair cost Vadodara</strong> depends on site inspection.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-[#1A202C] text-white relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl my-12 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(#D4AF37 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 30px 30px;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 py-12\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Serving all Vadodara Localities</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n                    If you&#8217;re looking for <strong>Himalaya AC service near me</strong>, our independent technicians are active across Alkapuri, Makarpura, Karelibaug, Nizampura, and the surrounding GIDCs to ensure your cooling is restored within 90 minutes.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-12\">\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Alkapuri</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3